{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说，新吾。你和爱理她们说什么了？」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4414", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也没什么，我就是感觉大家凑到一块笑得都挺膈应的，\\n　还说让我圣诞节好好休息什么的」", "text_idx": 145, "plain": "「也没什么，我就是感觉大家凑到一块笑得都挺膈应的，　还说让我圣诞节好好休息什么的」", "plain_idx": 146, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4415", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就在想，是不是你背地里偷偷和她们商量好了，\\n　让我们放个假～之类的」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": "「我就在想，是不是你背地里偷偷和她们商量好了，　让我们放个假～之类的」", "plain_idx": 149, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4416", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我什么都没说啊，不过确实感觉有点不自然」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后今天就变成我和纱凪两个人一起照顾动物们。", "text_idx": 152, "plain": "然后今天就变成我和纱凪两个人一起照顾动物们。", "plain_idx": 152, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算了不管了。反正，\\n　我本来24号下午就想请个假的」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": "「算了不管了。反正，　我本来24号下午就想请个假的」", "plain_idx": 154, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4417", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，还记得之前约好的吗？」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4418", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我要扮成圣诞老人，\\n　给理央送去礼物，对吧」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "「嗯，我要扮成圣诞老人，　给理央送去礼物，对吧」", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯。然后我就，锵锵！\\n　感觉正常着装有点缺少气氛，\\n　我还拿了圣诞老人的衣服和驯鹿的玩偶服」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": "「嗯嗯。然后我就，锵锵！　感觉正常着装有点缺少气氛，　我还拿了圣诞老人的衣服和驯鹿的玩偶服」", "plain_idx": 161, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4419", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咱们就穿着这个，半夜从窗户溜进理央的房间。\\n　当天就是这么个作战计划」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "「咱们就穿着这个，半夜从窗户溜进理央的房间。　当天就是这么个作战计划」", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4420", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还挺正式啊。\\n　说起来，这衣服是从谁那拿的？」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": "「还挺正式啊。　说起来，这衣服是从谁那拿的？」", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「万智老师好像打算把它们丢到后面的焚化炉里处理掉来着，\\n　然后我就拿过来了」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": "「万智老师好像打算把它们丢到后面的焚化炉里处理掉来着，　然后我就拿过来了」", "plain_idx": 169, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4421", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我听说，她好像每年都会穿着这个一个人庆祝」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": "「我听说，她好像每年都会穿着这个一个人庆祝」", "plain_idx": 171, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4422", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一、一个人？」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。然后就是，她不建议我一个人扮成驯鹿」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「嗯。然后就是，她不建议我一个人扮成驯鹿」", "plain_idx": 174, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4423", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一瞬间，万智老师穿着驯鹿装，\\n一个人孤零零待在房间里的样子浮现在我脑海中。", "text_idx": 176, "plain": "一瞬间，万智老师穿着驯鹿装，一个人孤零零待在房间里的样子浮现在我脑海中。", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉不太笑得出来。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哪怕是在开玩笑，也完全笑不出来。", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～机会难得，要不穿上试试？\\n　我也有点在意尺寸合不合适……」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": "「嗯～机会难得，要不穿上试试？　我也有点在意尺寸合不合适……」", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4424", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也是。那我就……」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「给你，驯鹿」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4425", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我来扮圣诞老人，\\n　所以就麻烦你扮拉雪橇的驯鹿咯♪」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": "「我来扮圣诞老人，　所以就麻烦你扮拉雪橇的驯鹿咯♪」", "plain_idx": 188, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4426", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃不是，等一下，说起圣诞老人，\\n　正常来说不都是那种留着大白胡子的老爷爷吗？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "「呃不是，等一下，说起圣诞老人，　正常来说不都是那种留着大白胡子的老爷爷吗？」", "plain_idx": 191, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4427", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不应该让我这个男生来演吗……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这不是没办法嘛。圣诞老人的衣服是女生的尺寸，\\n　而驯鹿装是均码的」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": "「这不是没办法嘛。圣诞老人的衣服是女生的尺寸，　而驯鹿装是均码的」", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4428", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且，这圣诞老人装就是给女生穿的款式」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4429", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你那怀疑的眼神是什么意思。\\n　总之我要试穿一下，你先出去一下好吗？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "「你那怀疑的眼神是什么意思。　总之我要试穿一下，你先出去一下好吗？」", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4430", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然后这个，给你，驯鹿的玩偶服」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4431", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪递给我一个白色的纸袋子，然后把我赶出了活动室。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……好冷。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也先试试这驯鹿服吧。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我为了能扮好圣诞老人，\\n就连洗澡的时候都在练习来着……", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "不过，我为了能扮好圣诞老人，就连洗澡的时候都在练习来着……", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说到底，哪有女的圣诞老人啊」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总觉得有点怪怪的，一点说服力都没有。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟是要给理央送礼物，真实感可是很重要的。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "待会我可得严厉地批判批判她。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我一边乱想一边换着衣服。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，可以进来了哦？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4432", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "活动室里传来声音，\\n我也正好换好驯鹿装，打开了门。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "活动室里传来声音，我也正好换好驯鹿装，打开了门。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「圣诞快乐～～♪」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4433", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿嘿，怎么样？看起来奇怪吗？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4434", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，怎么样？怎么样？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4435", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪扬起短裙，\\n向我这里翘起屁股。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "纱凪扬起短裙，向我这里翘起屁股。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这身衣服没想到还挺可爱的。\\n　我对万智老师的审美稍微有点改观了」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "「这身衣服没想到还挺可爱的。　我对万智老师的审美稍微有点改观了」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4436", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "衣服怎样自不必多说，\\n纱凪那股子可爱劲也被无限放大了。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "衣服怎样自不必多说，纱凪那股子可爱劲也被无限放大了。", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女生圣诞老人，原来真的存在。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，应该说这世界上不再需要男性圣诞老人了。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说回来，你这副打扮……噗呵呵！」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4437", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被纱凪这么一指，我回过神来。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我这身奇怪吗？」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有没有，可太合适了。\\n　可爱得我都心跳加速了……噗！」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「没有没有，可太合适了。　可爱得我都心跳加速了……噗！」", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4438", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我完全不信纱凪说的话。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎～竟然还带着这么好的项圈和铃铛」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4439", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉项圈稍微有点紧」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，万智老师说过来着，\\n　她自己把项圈弄得很紧，要注意一下」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「啊，万智老师说过来着，　她自己把项圈弄得很紧，要注意一下」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4440", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她自己用，是指这个项圈？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里好像还挺讲究的哦？\\n　项圈必须要紧一点」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": "「这里好像还挺讲究的哦？　项圈必须要紧一点」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4441", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我渐渐觉得万智老师有点陌生。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过穿成这样果然还是会有点激动啊。\\n　啊，圣诞节快点来吧～」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「不过穿成这样果然还是会有点激动啊。　啊，圣诞节快点来吧～」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4442", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我建议你不要这样蹦蹦跳跳的」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4443", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为裙子还是有点短」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，裙子？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4444", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪捏住裙摆，看向自己脚下。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，她再次跳了一下，\\n向我这里翘起了屁股。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "然后，她再次跳了一下，向我这里翘起了屁股。", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快看快看，我光着腿哦～我露我露♪」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4445", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不会被你带跑偏的，还有别翘屁股了」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，男生可真难懂。\\n　我本来是想好好装下可爱献献媚的，\\n　原来你不会对这种事情感到心动啊」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「唔，男生可真难懂。　我本来是想好好装下可爱献献媚的，　原来你不会对这种事情感到心动啊」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4446", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「会的！我确实是会心动的！」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「驯鹿先生别急呀」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4447", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这丫头可真是没有自知之明啊。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她完全不知道，\\n自己在常人眼里有多可爱……", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "她完全不知道，自己在常人眼里有多可爱……", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不过确实，\\n　不穿内衣的话还是有点凉飕飕的，感觉不太踏实」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「啊，不过确实，　不穿内衣的话还是有点凉飕飕的，感觉不太踏实」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4448", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不能不穿内衣啊！」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗，我开玩笑的啦。\\n　别这么生气嘛」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「噗，我开玩笑的啦。　别这么生气嘛」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4449", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，呃呃……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，小鹿鹿可真可爱呀♪\\n　乖乖乖，给你摸摸头～」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "「哎呀，小鹿鹿可真可爱呀♪　乖乖乖，给你摸摸头～」", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4450", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "完全被她戏耍了。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我倒也不讨厌。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗呵呵，想想都好笑。\\n　你竟然也会那么着急啊」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "「噗呵呵，想想都好笑。　你竟然也会那么着急啊」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4451", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说，你想要什么礼物呀？我露我露♪」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4452", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不用送我礼物」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，生气了？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4453", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没生气」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你在就行，有你我就满足了」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4454", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我不是纱凪是圣诞老人……\\n　不对，驯鹿不许勾引圣诞老人」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「我、我不是纱凪是圣诞老人……　不对，驯鹿不许勾引圣诞老人」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4455", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，驯鹿是怎么叫的？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嘿嘿叫吧？」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4456", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "驯鹿应该不是这么叫的吧。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，嘿嘿叫两声我听听。\\n　我想听你嘿嘿叫♪」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「哎，嘿嘿叫两声我听听。　我想听你嘿嘿叫♪」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4457", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，来嘛。来，“嘿嘿”，不行吗？不愿意叫吗？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4458", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是叫了，\\n　我就再跳一下，翘下屁股给你看♪」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "「你要是叫了，　我就再跳一下，翘下屁股给你看♪」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4459", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿！」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我心中，某些重要之物响起了崩裂的声音。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
